ndColor": "#ffffff", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": ["rp-1a-nutri-m-g"], "index": "c0cb", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1199179667, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "updated": 1793881802872, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 700068205}, {"id": "rp-1a-nutri-m-t", "type": "text", "x": 61535.5, "y": 1051, "width": 9, "height": 18, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 15, "frameId": null, "groupIds": ["rp-1a-nutri-m-g"], "index": "c0cc", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "5", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 981473480, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "5", "textAlign": "center", "updated": 1793881802872, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 637311202, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-1a-tab", "type": "rectangle", "x": 61780, "y": 210, "width": 1000, "height": 980, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cd", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1636199718, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793881802872, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1135134640}, {"id": "rp-1a-tab-t", "type": "text", "x": 61804, "y": 230, "width": 286, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0ce", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Mesures desktop (px r\u00e9els)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 127279367, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Mesures desktop (px r\u00e9els)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802872, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 515702891, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-1a-tab-b", "type": "text", "x": 61804, "y": 274, "width": 952, "height": 403.75, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cf", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte blanche 736 \u00d7 1708 centr\u00e9e (x 352, y 123), rayon 24,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0marge interne 40 ; fond de page Stone 100.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Photo 656 \u00d7 300, rayon 12 ; titre 40 px Young Serif Stone 900,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a040 sous la photo ; introduction 16 px Outfit 400 Stone 600,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0lignes de 24 px.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Preparation time \u00bb : encadr\u00e9 656 \u00d7 180, rayon 12, Rose 50,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0marge 28 ; titre 20 px Outfit 600 Rose 800 ; 3 \u00e9l\u00e9ments 16 px,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0tous les 32 px, puces Rose 800, libell\u00e9 en gras.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Titres de section 28 px Young Serif Brown 800 ; listes 16 px,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00e9l\u00e9ments tous les 32 px (24 entre deux lignes d'un m\u00eame\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00e9l\u00e9ment) ; puces et num\u00e9ros Brown 800, texte \u00e0 40 du bord ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0s\u00e9parateurs 1 px Stone 150 entre les sections, 32 au-dessus\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0et au-dessous.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Nutrition \u00bb : phrase 16 px puis tableau de 4 lignes de 48 px,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0s\u00e9parateurs Stone 150 ; libell\u00e9 \u00e0 32 du bord, valeur 16 px 700\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Brown 800 \u00e0 x 728 (colonne \u00e0 mi-largeur).\n\nTailles : titre 40 \u00b7 encadr\u00e9 20 \u00b7 sections 28 \u00b7 texte 16\n(\u2264 1,5 % d'\u00e9cart).", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 2023631445, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte blanche 736 \u00d7 1708 centr\u00e9e (x 352, y 123), rayon 24,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0marge interne 40 ; fond de page Stone 100.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Photo 656 \u00d7 300, rayon 12 ; titre 40 px Young Serif Stone 900,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a040 sous la photo ; introduction 16 px Outfit 400 Stone 600,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0lignes de 24 px.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Preparation time \u00bb : encadr\u00e9 656 \u00d7 180, rayon 12, Rose 50,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0marge 28 ; titre 20 px Outfit 600 Rose 800 ; 3 \u00e9l\u00e9ments 16 px,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0tous les 32 px, puces Rose 800, libell\u00e9 en gras.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Titres de section 28 px Young Serif Brown 800 ; listes 16 px,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00e9l\u00e9ments tous les 32 px (24 entre deux lignes d'un m\u00eame\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00e9l\u00e9ment) ; puces et num\u00e9ros Brown 800, texte \u00e0 40 du bord ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0s\u00e9parateurs 1 px Stone 150 entre les sections, 32 au-dessus\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0et au-dessous.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Nutrition \u00bb : phrase 16 px puis tableau de 4 lignes de 48 px,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0s\u00e9parateurs Stone 150 ; libell\u00e9 \u00e0 32 du bord, valeur 16 px 700\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Brown 800 \u00e0 x 728 (colonne \u00e0 mi-largeur).\n\nTailles : titre 40 \u00b7 encadr\u00e9 20 \u00b7 sections 28 \u00b7 texte 16\n(\u2264 1,5 % d'\u00e9cart).", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802872, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1983185315, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-1b-t", "type": "text", "x": 62840, "y": 170, "width": 407, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cg", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 2043 (haut de page)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 525056606, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 2043 (haut de page)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802872, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 52497752, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-img-m-cadre", "type": "rectangle", "x": 62840, "y": 210, "width": 375, "height": 1000, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0ch", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1828675037, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793881802875, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1503154607}, {"id": "rp-1b-photo", "type": "rectangle", "x": 62840, "y": 210, "width": 375, "height": 171, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0ci", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 999099380, "strokeColor": "#c2255c", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "updated": 1793881802875, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 970124494}, {"id": "rp-1b-photo-m", "type": "ellipse", "x": 63188, "y": 216, "width": 28, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": ["rp-1b-photo-m-g"], "index": "c0cj", "isDeleted": false,