, "width": 9, "height": 18, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 15, "frameId": null, "groupIds": ["rp-1b-prep-m-g"], "index": "c0cn", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1971499676, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2", "textAlign": "center", "updated": 1793881802876, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 627947672, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-1b-tab", "type": "rectangle", "x": 63260, "y": 210, "width": 640, "height": 420, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0co", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 660717693, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793881802876, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1983520209}, {"id": "rp-1b-tab-t", "type": "text", "x": 63284, "y": 230, "width": 220, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cp", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Mesures mobile (375)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 429608570, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Mesures mobile (375)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802876, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1651815494, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-1b-tab-b", "type": "text", "x": 63284, "y": 274, "width": 592, "height": 212.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cq", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Pas de carte : la page est blanche, marges 32.\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Photo pleine largeur 375 \u00d7 171, sans rayon.\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Titre 36 px Young Serif, 2 lignes.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Encadr\u00e9 311 \u00d7 191, rayon 12 ; m\u00eames\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0tailles qu'en desktop (20, 16, 28 px).\nLes puces sont centr\u00e9es sur les \u00e9l\u00e9ments de\ndeux lignes (Q-B1).\n\nProposition (Q-B3) : < 768 px mobile ;\n\u2265 768 px carte de 736 px centr\u00e9e.", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 304814540, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Pas de carte : la page est blanche, marges 32.\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Photo pleine largeur 375 \u00d7 171, sans rayon.\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Titre 36 px Young Serif, 2 lignes.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Encadr\u00e9 311 \u00d7 191, rayon 12 ; m\u00eames\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0tailles qu'en desktop (20, 16, 28 px).\nLes puces sont centr\u00e9es sur les \u00e9l\u00e9ments de\ndeux lignes (Q-B1).\n\nProposition (Q-B3) : < 768 px mobile ;\n\u2265 768 px carte de 736 px centr\u00e9e.", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802879, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2146413382, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-1c-t", "type": "text", "x": 61000, "y": 1280, "width": 319, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cr", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1C \u00b7 Arbre HTML (proposition)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 2139752609, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1C \u00b7 Arbre HTML (proposition)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802879, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 277307333, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-1c-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 61000, "y": 1320, "width": 1200, "height": 320, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cs", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 198931208, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793881802880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 167395856}, {"id": "rp-1c-b", "type": "text", "x": 61024, "y": 1344, "width": 1150, "height": 160, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 3, "fontSize": 16, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0ct", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "main > article\n\u251c\u2500 img (alt, Q-B4) \u00b7 h1 \u00ab Simple Omelette Recipe \u00bb \u00b7 p\n\u251c\u2500 section \u00ab Preparation time \u00bb : h2 + ul (libell\u00e9s en strong)\n\u251c\u2500 section : h2 \u00ab Ingredients \u00bb + ul\n\u251c\u2500 section : h2 \u00ab Instructions \u00bb + ol (d\u00e9but de chaque \u00e9tape en strong)\n\u2514\u2500 section : h2 \u00ab Nutrition \u00bb + p + table\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a04 \u00d7 tr : th scope=\"row\" (Calories\u2026) + td (277kcal\u2026) (Q-B2)\nfooter : attribution FM (2 liens)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1546841453, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "main > article\n\u251c\u2500 img (alt, Q-B4) \u00b7 h1 \u00ab Simple Omelette Recipe \u00bb \u00b7 p\n\u251c\u2500 section \u00ab Preparation time \u00bb : h2 + ul (libell\u00e9s en strong)\n\u251c\u2500 section : h2 \u00ab Ingredients \u00bb + ul\n\u251c\u2500 section : h2 \u00ab Instructions \u00bb + ol (d\u00e9but de chaque \u00e9tape en strong)\n\u2514\u2500 section : h2 \u00ab Nutrition \u00bb + p + table\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a04 \u00d7 tr : th scope=\"row\" (Calories\u2026) + td (277kcal\u2026) (Q-B2)\nfooter : attribution FM (2 liens)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1713392827, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-2b", "type": "rectangle", "x": 62240, "y": 1320, "width": 1240, "height": 320, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cu", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 807482150, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793881802880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 21920178}, {"id": "rp-2b-t", "type": "text", "x": 62264, "y": 1340, "width": 385, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cv", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2A \u00b7 Interactifs et 2B \u00b7 contrastes", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 325932807, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2A \u00b7 Interactifs et 2B \u00b7 contrastes", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1116144237, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-2b-b", "type": "text", "x": 62264, "y": 1384, "width": 1192, "height": 120, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 16, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cw", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Interactifs : seulement les 2 liens de l'attribution (survol, contour\nde focus 2 px d\u00e9cal\u00e9 de 2 px). Rien d'autre n'est cliquable.\n\nContrastes, tous AA : texte Stone 600 sur blanc 7,09:1 et sur Rose 50\n6,65:1 ; titres et valeurs Brown 800 7,19:1 ; \u00ab Preparation time \u00bb\nRose 800 8,72:1 ; titre Stone 900 13,66:1. Puces et num\u00e9ros \u2265 7:1.", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 74801239, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Interactifs : seulement les 2 liens de l'attribution (survol, contour\nde focus 2 px d\u00e9cal\u00e9 de 2 px). Rien d'autre n'est cliquable.\n\nContrastes, tous AA : texte Stone 600 sur blanc 7,09:1 et sur Rose 50\n6,65:1 ; titres et valeurs Brown 800 7,19:1 ; \u00ab Preparation time \u00bb\nRose 800 8,72:1 ; titre Stone 900 13,66:1. Puces et num\u00e9ros \u2265 7:1.", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 436143011, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-2d-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60980, "y": 1680, "width": 2520, "height": 230, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cx", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1513826490, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "updated": 1793881802880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1861981972}, {"id": "rp-2d-t", "type": "text", "x": 61000, "y": 1700, "width": 748, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cy", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1882440097, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 176142079, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "rp-2d-b", "type": "text", "x": 61000, "y": 1744, "width": 2480, "height": 106.25, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c0cz", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Q-B1\u00a0\u00a0Mobile : puces centr\u00e9es sur les \u00e9l\u00e9ments de deux lignes. (Puces align\u00e9es sur la premi\u00e8re ligne, comme en desktop.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Tableau nutritionnel sans en-t\u00eate. (th scope=\"row\" pour les nutriments, td pour les valeurs.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Tablette dessin\u00e9e seulement dans le fichier Figma (Pro). (Carte de 736 px centr\u00e9e d\u00e8s 768 px ; en dessous, la disposition mobile.)\nQ-B4\u00a0\u00a0Texte alternatif de la photo. (\u00ab Omelette folded over spinach and vegetables, served on a plate \u00bb.)\nQ-B5\u00a0\u00a0D\u00e9but des \u00e9tapes en gras. (strong, et \u00ab : \u00bb hors du gras comme sur l'image.)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 41272651, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Q-B1\u00a0\u00a0Mobile : puces centr\u00e9es sur les \u00e9l\u00e9ments de deux lignes. (Puces align\u00e9es sur la premi\u00e8re ligne, comme en desktop.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Tableau nutritionnel sans en-t\u00eate. (th scope=\"row\" pour les nutriments, td pour les valeurs.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Tablette dessin\u00e9e seulement dans le fichier Figma (Pro). (Carte de 736 px centr\u00e9e d\u00e8s 768 px ; en dessous, la disposition mobile.)\nQ-B4\u00a0\u00a0Texte alternatif de la photo. (\u00ab Omelette folded over spinach and vegetables, served on a plate \u00bb.)\nQ-B5\u00a0\u00a0D\u00e9but des \u00e9tapes en gras. (strong, et \u00ab : \u00bb hors du gras comme sur l'image.)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793881802880, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 743447455, "verticalAlign": "top"}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {"rp-img-d-file": {"id": "rp-img-d-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793881790295}, "rp-img-m-file": {"id": "rp-img-m-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793881790295}}}